# Cslib.LTS.generatedBy

Topic: computability   Node: 30676ccc9ad3

Provenance: formalization of a published result. Source: CSLib, `Cslib.LTS.generatedBy`. Lean proof by Fabrizio Montesi, from https://github.com/leanprover/cslib/blob/3951377e5a3f5772737f11cd62bc5bb6a72f95d1/Cslib/Foundations/Semantics/LTS/Basic.lean (Copyright (c) 2025 Fabrizio Montesi. All rights reserved, Apache-2.0); 1 adapted; compiled here.

The LTS generated by a state `s` is the LTS given by all the states reachable from `s`.
